{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"眼前的亲近让他真切地高兴，他也更想知道对方是否同样珍惜他。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想被珍惜，也不愿逼对方回应，更不愿让对方替他消除所有不安。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼对方回应\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他试过收住心意，也尽情喜欢过，仍没把握对方会不会选择他。\",\n      \"key\": \"没把握\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕失望，却仍认真喜欢，心里难受时不再哄自己说不在乎回应。\",\n      \"key\": \"哄自己\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"动摇\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R57\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把没有着落明确为想知道对方是否同样珍惜他，写出眼前的幸福如何让这个愿望重新变得重要。S12-2的相互珍惜之愿与S12-5的未获保证共同解释这份酸楚，不再只说幸福之后仍有缺憾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去深情不能决定对方选择的抽象判断，用他试过收住心意、也尽情喜欢过却仍没把握的经历，保留两种做法各有局限的关键。此前克制带来的安心、盼望仍在以及眼前幸福未带来保证，分别由跨段箭头承接。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\", \"R62\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\", \"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"S13-2保留不逼对方回应、不让对方负责消除所有不安的边界；S13-4承接不因怕失望而削弱喜欢的部分。这样保留了两种不同的坚持，也避免连续重复宣告冲突仍在。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R63\", \"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把冲突带来的难受与拒绝自欺写成他仍认真喜欢、仍在意回应的具体选择。他没有靠否认愿望换取轻松，为下一段不再寻找绝不会受伤的爱法留下明确前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "56735d41-5002-4fb0-89b0-ad57ee2acb3e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T111820741254Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1003.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:35:04.635155+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d6df27356035cdbe34b46e6834008e9a652fac13bab7710d323aa19218c84926", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T111820741254Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "ec1fc9eb0a9dd0cee804d576cfb943157890be5ddf06c1775d11a623c7188691"}}}
